Package: descriptiveStats
Type: Package
Title: Descriptive Statistics for Numeric Vectors
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Eric", "Shen", email = "shen.y.eric@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions to compute common descriptive statistics (mean, median, mode, first quartile,
    third quartile, and interquartile range) for numeric vectors. All functions handle NA values
    and invalid inputs with informative messages.
